{'symbol': 'CNC', 'date': '2022-01-12 11:01:00', 'title': "MORE CALIFORNIA CHILDREN CAN ACCESS TELEHEALTH AT SCHOOL THANKS TO HEALTH NET'S $3 MILLION GRANT TO SPONSOR HAZEL HEALTH", 'text': "SAN FRANCISCO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEALTH NET, ONE OF CALIFORNIA'S LONGEST SERVING AND MOST EXPERIENCED MEDI-CAL PARTNERS, HAS AWARDED A $3 MILLION GRANT TO HAZEL HEALTH, THE NATIONAL LEADER IN SCHOOL-BASED TELEHEALTH. THE GRANT WILL EXPAND ACCESS TO HIGH QUALITY PHYSICAL AND MENTAL HEALTH CARE FOR STUDENTS AT 200 K-12 SCHOOLS IN TEN CALIFORNIA COUNTIES. THROUGH HAZEL HEALTH'S TELEHEALTH SERVICES, STUDENTS CAN CONNECT DIRECTLY WITH LICENSED MEDICAL PROFESSIONALS FOR ON-DEMAND CARE, WHETHER AT SCHO"}